==========================================================================
DOMINANT (PISOT) ROOT of  x^d = x^{d-1} + 1
==========================================================================
  d=1: dominant root of x^1=x^0+1  ->  2.0000000000   2
  d=2: dominant root of x^2=x^1+1  ->  1.6180339887   golden phi=1.6180339887
  d=3: dominant root of x^3=x^2+1  ->  1.4655712319   supergolden/plastic-adjacent psi=1.4655712319
  d=4: dominant root of x^4=x^3+1  ->  1.3802775691   1.3802775691
  d=5: dominant root of x^5=x^4+1  ->  1.3247179572   1.3247...(plastic? no)
  d=6: dominant root of x^6=x^5+1  ->  1.2851990332   
  (d=2 golden ratio; d=3 'supergolden ratio' 1.4656, root of x^3=x^2+1)

